   "group": "Front of house",
   "duties": "Run the venue. Confirm volunteers on time, projectionist has the right film + Q&A cued, meet the emcee, supervise wranglers/scanners, get rush count from box office for scanners, VIPs/moderator arrive early, cleanup arranged."
